WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.498
In Exhibitions, choose New exhibit. Give it a title and description. Choose Private while you build, then choose Create Exhibition.

00:00:10.498 --> 00:00:19.401
Open Edit Add. Search or filter your vault, select the items for this exhibit, then use Save at the bottom of the picker.

00:00:19.401 --> 00:00:30.213
Choose a theme and shelf style. Use Organize to arrange the display. Save your changes, then use Preview to check the visitor experience.

00:00:30.213 --> 00:00:41.841
Review User Access Mode before sharing. When you want a public exhibition, choose Public Exhibit and use Copy Link. Check the shared view before sending it.
